    "machine_start_gcode": ";======= SEEMECNC ARTEMIS START G-CODE =======\nG21             ; Set units to mm\nG90             ; Absolute positioning\nM82             ; Extruder to absolute mode\nG28             ; Home all axes\nG1 Z50 F9000    ; Lift nozzle for safe heating\n\n; --- SELECT STARTING TOOL ---\nT[initial_tool]  ; Activate the first assigned filament in OrcaSlicer\n\n; --- PREHEAT ---\nM140 S[first_layer_bed_temperature] ; Start bed heating\nM104 S[first_layer_temperature]     ; Start nozzle heating\nM190 S[first_layer_bed_temperature] ; Wait for bed to reach temp\nM109 S[first_layer_temperature]     ; Wait for nozzle to reach temp\n\n; --- RE-PRIME BOWDEN TUBE ---\nG92 E0          ; Zero extruder\nG1 E160.5 F3000 ; Push filament back: 159mm tube + 1.5mm from end retract\nG92 E0          ; Zero again\n\n; --- PURGE LINE (curved arc near front edge, 300mm bed) ---\nG92 E0\nG1 X-50 Y-130 Z0.4 F5000   ; Move to arc start (inside 150mm radius)\nG1 Z0.3 F1000               ; Drop to prime height\nG3 X50 Y-130 R139.3 E40 F600 ; Arc purge, 100mm sweep, heavy extrusion\nG1 X65 Y-120 Z0.2 F6000    ; Wipe move\nG1 Z5 F5000                 ; Lift nozzle\nG92 E0                      ; Zero extruder before print\n;======= END START G-CODE =======",
